WEBVTT

00:22.564 --> 00:24.691
The numbness is severe…

00:25.775 --> 00:27.318
because of these needles.

00:27.861 --> 00:32.824
I just got out of the water pot,
but I can't…

00:37.120 --> 00:40.582
Kotetsu…

00:49.841 --> 00:52.635
I'm losing strength.

00:54.763 --> 00:58.016
I can't…

01:01.603 --> 01:03.396
You can do it, Muichiro.

01:03.480 --> 01:05.231
Come on, get up.

01:06.483 --> 01:08.026
Father?

01:23.458 --> 01:26.461
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

02:40.160 --> 02:44.956
EPISODE 8: THE "MU" OF MUICHIRO

02:48.501 --> 02:52.505
That's right. My father was a lumberjack.

02:53.172 --> 02:58.469
As his son, I helped him cut down trees.

03:06.936 --> 03:08.146
I…

03:12.942 --> 03:17.155
I liked helping my father.

03:23.036 --> 03:24.662
Mother, are you all right?

03:24.746 --> 03:28.291
Father is going out to pick herbs for you.

03:28.374 --> 03:29.959
Mother!

03:35.173 --> 03:37.217
Her temperature is high.

03:49.646 --> 03:53.524
Use my futon. How does it feel, Mother?

03:55.735 --> 03:57.195
I'm cold.

04:00.531 --> 04:03.618
Father will be home soon!

04:32.939 --> 04:34.107
That day…

04:35.024 --> 04:41.656
I lost both of my beloved parents.

04:44.784 --> 04:47.704
They died when I was ten.

04:48.538 --> 04:51.082
At the age of ten, I was alone.

04:53.543 --> 04:54.836
Muichiro.

04:56.754 --> 04:58.756
No, that's wrong.

04:58.840 --> 05:01.676
I wasn't alone until I was eleven.

05:03.011 --> 05:04.304
I…

05:04.929 --> 05:06.889
I had a twin brother.

05:08.308 --> 05:11.561
My older brother's name was Yuichiro.

05:15.940 --> 05:18.443
They say compassion is not
for other people's benefit.

05:18.526 --> 05:22.530
Even if you help someone else,
it'll just make the situation worse.

05:23.031 --> 05:24.407
You're wrong.

05:24.490 --> 05:30.079
That expression means helping others
eventually ends up being good for you.

05:30.163 --> 05:32.081
That's what Father said.

05:32.165 --> 05:37.336
You can't trust the words of a man
who died trying to save someone else.

05:38.379 --> 05:40.548
Why would you say that?

05:40.631 --> 05:42.842
Father did his best to save our mother.

05:42.925 --> 05:46.637
There's no way herbs could have saved her
in that condition.

05:46.721 --> 05:48.347
He was completely foolish.

05:48.431 --> 05:50.641
You're being mean.

05:51.059 --> 05:56.105
If he hadn't gone out in a storm,
we would've only lost our mother.

05:56.189 --> 05:59.650
Don't talk like that! That's too much!

05:59.734 --> 06:01.903
I'm just telling the truth.

06:01.986 --> 06:05.740
You're so loud. Keep your voice down,
or the boars will come.

06:06.991 --> 06:10.328
The "Mu" of Muichiro is taken
from "Munou", which means incompetence.

06:10.411 --> 06:12.497
This conversation is pointless.

06:12.580 --> 06:15.166
In the end, the past never changes.

06:16.125 --> 06:19.670
The "Mu" of Muichiro is taken
from "Muimi", which means meaningless.

06:26.844 --> 06:29.639
My brother had a harsh tongue.

06:30.389 --> 06:35.561
Somehow I feel I was like him
when I had no memories.

06:38.106 --> 06:42.693
Living alone with him was stifling.

06:43.319 --> 06:46.572
I thought he hated me.

06:47.156 --> 06:50.326
And I thought he was a cold person.

06:51.536 --> 06:53.746
The seasons passed.

06:55.039 --> 06:56.541
And spring came.

06:59.085 --> 07:01.963
Brother, I'm going to get some water.

07:02.463 --> 07:04.465
I can't believe you haven't done that yet.

07:28.781 --> 07:30.783
She was very beautiful.

07:31.784 --> 07:36.122
At first, I thought she was
the spirit of the birch tree.

07:36.998 --> 07:40.918
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

07:41.002 --> 07:44.922
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

07:46.215 --> 07:49.677
She said that she's the Master's wife.

07:50.136 --> 07:54.807
She came all the way to the mountains
just to make an offer.

07:55.475 --> 07:56.642
However…

07:59.770 --> 08:05.610
In the end, my brother turned Lady Amane
away with his harsh words.

08:06.861 --> 08:10.323
Isn't that amazing?
She said we're descendants of swordsmen!

08:10.406 --> 08:15.453
And of the bloodline of incredible people
who used the first Breathing Style!

08:15.536 --> 08:18.789
It has nothing to do with us.
Hurry up and wash the rice.

08:18.873 --> 08:20.958
Hey! Let's become swordsmen!

08:21.042 --> 08:24.587
It's hard to believe that
there are demons in this world,

08:24.670 --> 08:27.048
but we can be helpful.

08:27.131 --> 08:28.007
Come on!

08:28.090 --> 08:31.219
Let's help people who are hurt by demons!

08:31.302 --> 08:32.595
I'm sure we can--

08:47.109 --> 08:49.612
What could you do?

08:49.695 --> 08:53.032
You, who can't even cook rice by yourself,
want to become a swordsman?

08:53.115 --> 08:54.367
You want to help people?

08:54.450 --> 08:56.869
Stop being an idiot!

08:56.953 --> 09:00.331
You really are exactly
like Father and Mother!

09:00.414 --> 09:02.166
You're too optimistic!

09:02.250 --> 09:03.918
Is something wrong with your head?

09:04.001 --> 09:07.964
You're the same as Mother, who got sick
without telling us and kept working,

09:08.047 --> 09:11.133
and the same as Father,
who went out to gather herbs in a storm!

09:11.592 --> 09:12.677
Despite how…

09:12.760 --> 09:15.179
Despite how much I tried to stop him,

09:15.263 --> 09:18.766
and how I always told Mother to rest!

09:18.849 --> 09:23.771
Helping someone else is something
only chosen people can do!

09:23.854 --> 09:28.526
Even if our ancestors were swordsmen,
what can we kids do?

09:28.609 --> 09:31.279
You want to know what we can do?

09:31.362 --> 09:33.155
There's only one thing we can do!

09:33.239 --> 09:35.658
It's to die pointlessly! We have no value!

09:35.741 --> 09:38.411
Because we're Father
and Mother's children.

09:38.494 --> 09:41.080
In the end, that woman will use us!

09:41.163 --> 09:43.040
I'm sure she's plotting something!

09:43.499 --> 09:46.085
This conversation is over! Understand?

09:46.168 --> 09:48.671
Now go and prepare for dinner!

09:54.468 --> 09:59.056
And from that moment on,
we stopped talking.

10:00.558 --> 10:03.477
One time we had a fight

10:03.561 --> 10:08.649
when he doused Lady Amane with water
because she continued visiting our home.

10:41.807 --> 10:43.476
Summer came.

10:43.559 --> 10:48.314
That summer was really hot.
It made us irritable all the time.

10:49.273 --> 10:52.693
Even the nights were hot.
The cicadas buzzed.

11:39.323 --> 11:43.327
There are only two kids?

11:44.620 --> 11:45.871
Oh, well…

11:45.955 --> 11:47.164
Muichiro!

11:53.963 --> 11:56.841
-It hurts! It hurts!
-Big brother! Big brother!

12:04.765 --> 12:07.143
You're so noisy! Shut up!

12:07.226 --> 12:09.019
Don't make a fuss.

12:09.478 --> 12:15.234
Poor lumberjacks like you
are useless anyway.

12:15.526 --> 12:18.320
Whether you're there or not,
it makes no difference.

12:18.404 --> 12:21.949
Your lives are worthless.

12:25.077 --> 12:28.998
Everything I saw was red.

12:29.790 --> 12:33.002
It was a rage I had never felt before,

12:33.085 --> 12:38.382
that came out from the pit of my stomach.

12:39.133 --> 12:42.470
I can't remember anything
that happened after.

12:42.553 --> 12:45.556
Even now, It's hard to believe…

12:46.682 --> 12:50.853
that tremendous roar
came from my own throat.

13:00.905 --> 13:04.325
The next thing I knew,
that demon was dying.

13:04.408 --> 13:09.747
But he was in agony because he couldn't
die even if his head was crushed.

13:21.300 --> 13:23.552
It wasn't long before the sun rose.

13:24.428 --> 13:27.223
That demon turned to dust and vanished.

13:27.306 --> 13:29.725
But I didn't care at all.

13:35.064 --> 13:39.235
I wanted to reach Yuichiro
as soon as possible,

13:39.318 --> 13:42.821
but suddenly my body
became as heavy as lead.

13:42.905 --> 13:48.035
It took me quite a long time to get to
my house, although it was in front of me.

13:54.959 --> 14:00.548
God, please… save him.

14:01.173 --> 14:02.675
Big brother…

14:02.758 --> 14:05.302
Are you still alive?

14:19.650 --> 14:26.615
God… Buddha… Please…

14:27.783 --> 14:34.290
Please… save my brother at least.

14:40.713 --> 14:45.217
He's not like me.

14:45.301 --> 14:49.221
He's a kind-hearted kid.

14:49.305 --> 14:54.018
He wants to help people…

14:54.101 --> 14:57.271
but I stopped him.

14:59.148 --> 15:04.528
I'm the only one to blame.

15:05.279 --> 15:11.619
If you must punish someone…
punish me alone.

15:14.038 --> 15:17.291
I've known it for a long time.

15:18.542 --> 15:20.127
The truth is…

15:21.629 --> 15:25.132
the "Mu" of Muichiro is taken from…

15:34.600 --> 15:38.479
"Mugen", which means limitless.

15:39.355 --> 15:42.399
Mist Breathing, Fourth Form:

15:49.281 --> 15:50.741
Shifting Flow Slash.

15:54.495 --> 15:55.454
Kotetsu!

15:55.996 --> 16:00.250
Tokito, don't mind me.

16:00.334 --> 16:03.504
Please help Haganezuka.

16:03.587 --> 16:06.674
Protect the sword.

16:09.635 --> 16:10.511
Sure.

16:14.598 --> 16:17.685
This particular guy!

16:17.768 --> 16:19.478
This man!

16:19.561 --> 16:21.647
This human!

16:22.106 --> 16:27.069
No matter what I do,
he won't stop sharpening it!

16:27.152 --> 16:33.325
Even when I crushed one of his eyes,
he didn't scream and just kept working.

16:36.328 --> 16:40.457
Right, if I tell him
I'm going to kill this guy…

16:45.004 --> 16:47.381
He got out of my Water Prison Pot.

16:47.464 --> 16:51.135
How did he do that? I don't get it.

16:51.218 --> 16:55.889
I thought he was going to die,
so wasn't paying attention to him.

16:56.598 --> 16:58.767
But, wait.

16:58.851 --> 17:03.856
This also means that that's how deeply
I was concentrating.

17:04.106 --> 17:05.274
All right!

17:06.650 --> 17:10.112
Wait, wait, wait! What is that mark?

17:10.654 --> 17:13.741
According to the information
I got from Lord Muzan,

17:13.824 --> 17:17.828
the boy with the earrings
has a similar mark.

17:17.911 --> 17:19.163
No, no, no.

17:19.246 --> 17:23.584
More importantly,
why did he show up so casually?

17:23.667 --> 17:28.505
He should have been paralyzed
by my attack.

17:28.964 --> 17:33.635
How could he wound me
by moving even faster than earlier?

17:36.346 --> 17:38.307
Octopus Vase Hell!

17:39.892 --> 17:41.226
Sir Tokito!

17:47.066 --> 17:50.652
Any comment about the elasticity
of this octopus flesh?

17:50.736 --> 17:52.905
You can't cut this, can you?

18:01.413 --> 18:03.832
He's still sharpening.

18:03.916 --> 18:07.419
Is he stupid? Surely, he's not sane.

18:07.503 --> 18:09.505
But that's all right too.

18:09.588 --> 18:13.175
The Hashira comes before that swordsmith.

18:13.258 --> 18:16.595
I went too easy on you before.

18:16.678 --> 18:21.058
This time I'll crush you and absorb you.

18:27.689 --> 18:30.901
You made a sword for me.

18:32.402 --> 18:33.278
DESTROY DEMONS

18:33.737 --> 18:36.698
Thank you, Mr. Kanamori.

18:39.076 --> 18:45.374
No, I just made it based on your first
swordsmith's written instructions.

18:46.083 --> 18:47.626
Right.

18:47.709 --> 18:51.755
Mr. Tetsuido was the person
who made my first sword.

18:51.839 --> 18:54.716
He died of heart disease.

18:56.051 --> 19:00.222
No matter how many swords he gets,
nothing will change.

19:07.062 --> 19:08.564
It feels so natural to me.

19:11.191 --> 19:14.236
I'm worried, Boy.

19:15.237 --> 19:20.242
I'm worried that no one will understand

19:20.325 --> 19:23.912
how many burdens you have,

19:24.371 --> 19:27.749
how much pressure you are under,

19:27.833 --> 19:32.629
how hard it is for you
not to remember things,

19:32.713 --> 19:35.924
and how desperately you worked.

19:36.550 --> 19:39.344
I wonder who will understand you.

19:40.095 --> 19:45.309
Every time I see the sword you used,
I shed tears.

19:46.643 --> 19:49.271
I don't have much time to live.

19:49.354 --> 19:52.316
Not that I want to live longer,

19:53.483 --> 19:58.071
but I can't help worrying about you.

20:00.073 --> 20:02.326
Mr. Tetsuido, I'm sorry.

20:03.076 --> 20:04.828
I made you worry.

20:05.495 --> 20:10.042
But now, I am all right.

20:11.501 --> 20:14.046
Mist Breathing, Fifth Form:

20:15.797 --> 20:16.965
Sea of Clouds and Haze!

20:22.471 --> 20:25.140
That's some fast chopping.

20:25.224 --> 20:28.894
But it seems you can't match
how fast I move through the vases.

20:29.728 --> 20:30.896
Is that so?

20:30.979 --> 20:32.314
What?

20:32.856 --> 20:35.609
It seems your senses are quite dull.

20:35.692 --> 20:38.028
It's because you've lived
for hundreds of years.

20:40.614 --> 20:42.241
Next, I'll sever it for sure.

20:42.324 --> 20:46.828
I can't keep playing around
with your stupid vases.

20:47.955 --> 20:51.041
Don't ever underestimate me,
you little brat.

20:59.299 --> 21:00.467
Muichiro.

21:01.927 --> 21:04.554
I'm sorry I couldn't be kinder.

21:06.682 --> 21:10.269
I couldn't afford to.

21:11.144 --> 21:13.355
After all, only the chosen ones…

21:14.189 --> 21:16.858
can be kind to others.

21:18.235 --> 21:20.237
But you know, Muichiro…

21:22.030 --> 21:24.533
No matter how righteously we live,

21:24.616 --> 21:29.329
the Gods and the Buddha
won't protect us in the end.

21:29.413 --> 21:32.624
So I thought I at least
had to protect you.

21:33.500 --> 21:37.379
Muichiro, you are not like me.

21:40.382 --> 21:43.135
In order to help someone,

21:44.928 --> 21:47.014
you can exert limitless power…

21:52.561 --> 21:54.855
because you are the chosen one.

23:26.071 --> 23:27.072
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC
NO. 8

23:27.739 --> 23:30.700
Kanroji, happy birthday!

23:31.952 --> 23:34.204
This is your present
from everyone in the village.

23:34.287 --> 23:35.288
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, MITSURI

23:35.372 --> 23:37.082
-It's all-you-can-eat!
-Wow!

23:37.165 --> 23:38.333
ALL-YOU-CAN-EAT! FROM OUR VILLAGE

23:38.416 --> 23:40.418
That means I can ask for refills, right?

23:40.502 --> 23:43.046
You'll still need refills after this much?

23:43.130 --> 23:44.381
Of course!

23:44.464 --> 23:45.799
I SHOULDN'T HAVE SAID
IT'S ALL-YOU-CAN-EAT…

23:46.258 --> 23:48.802
It's time for the Taishō era secret.

23:48.885 --> 23:52.305
Miss Kanroji's recent favorites
are stylish Western foods,

23:52.389 --> 23:55.642
such as pork cutlets and omelets.

23:55.725 --> 23:57.185
Therefore…

23:57.269 --> 23:59.813
These are birthday presents
from Nezuko and me.

23:59.896 --> 24:00.730
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, MISS KANROJI

24:01.940 --> 24:04.151
Thank you! Can I eat them now?

24:04.234 --> 24:05.610
Sure thing!

24:06.653 --> 24:10.532
Next up, Episode 9:
"Mist Hashira Muichiro Tokito"

24:10.615 --> 24:11.533
I want seconds!

24:11.658 --> 24:12.659
That was fast!

24:12.742 --> 24:14.703
More servings!

24:14.786 --> 24:15.996
TO BE CONTINUED
